<title>GERMANY: German IFO June business climate index rises.</title>
<headline>German IFO June business climate index rises.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German IFO economics institute gave the following data from its June business climate survey:</p>
<p>    West Germany		     June 1997     May 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  96.0	  95.4 (rev 95.3)</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     88.9	  87.3 (rev 87.2)</p>
<p>     Business expectations	  103.7	 104.1 (no rev)</p>
<p>    East Germany		     June 1997     May 1997</p>
<p>     Business climate		  103.6	103.7 (rev 103.5)</p>
<p>     Business conditions	     121.4	121.5 (rev 121.2)</p>
<p>     Business expectations 87.8 87.9 (rev 87.7)</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected the west German business climate index to rise to around 95.7 or 95.8 in June.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
